# Desktop UI

Follow the **harness-ui** skill (`.cursor/skills/harness-ui/SKILL.md`).

- Tokens: `src/renderer/base.css` — no new hardcoded colors/radii/type sizes.
- Component work: `npm run capture:storybook` → Read `tmp/ui-shots/storybook/*.png`.
- Surface work: `npm run capture:window` or `npm run capture:surfaces -- --launch`.
- Recapture and Read PNGs after edits before saying the UI looks correct.
